# XNU patches for xnu-12377.121.6, one per line in application order.
#
# Both come from the SM8450 layer, where they are the two patches every board
# on the waipio/cape family needed. They are copied rather than referenced so
# the SM8475 layer can review them against its own MPIDR numbering and PMGR.
#
# sheng-platform-power inserts the PMGR hook that the OS series'
# zzz-boot-progress.patch uses as context. XNU_SHENG_PMGR is unset on
# mondrian, so the hook compiles out; the hunk is still required.
sheng-platform-power.patch
# CPU numbering: SM8450 numbers the core in Affinity1; SM8475's MPIDRs are
# flat 0x000..0x700 and fit the same 16-bit mask. start.s must mask 16 bits
# when it runs the BCM2837 (4 KiB) machine config.
native-smp-secondary.patch
